WEBVTT

00:00:02.130 --> 00:00:03.390
All right, students!

00:00:03.790 --> 00:00:06.560
Now that final exams are over and 
the meat has been eaten,

00:00:06.560 --> 00:00:08.880
it is time for campus trash pickup!

00:00:08.880 --> 00:00:11.440
Okay...

00:00:11.820 --> 00:00:14.110
Not trash pickup again...

00:00:14.110 --> 00:00:17.340
This school makes food on its premises.

00:00:17.340 --> 00:00:19.370
The campus must be kept clean at all times!

00:00:19.620 --> 00:00:20.890
Oh, man.

00:00:20.890 --> 00:00:24.210
We just cleaned up a little while ago,
 but look at this mess.

00:00:24.450 --> 00:00:27.350
Sensei, there's industrial waste!

00:00:27.350 --> 00:00:29.030
Illegal dumping again?

00:00:29.030 --> 00:00:29.920
<i>Again?!</i>

00:00:30.690 --> 00:00:33.160
Komaba, can you get this?

00:00:33.530 --> 00:00:34.340
Sure!

00:00:34.740 --> 00:00:35.740
All right!

00:00:35.740 --> 00:00:36.940
I'm off!

00:00:36.940 --> 00:00:38.620
Wow, awesome!

00:00:38.620 --> 00:00:40.130
You go, future ace!

00:00:40.130 --> 00:00:41.350
Take it all the way to the nationals!

00:00:42.330 --> 00:00:45.050
<i>No point in brooding over it.</i>

00:00:45.050 --> 00:00:48.390
<i>I'll just focus my energy 
on what's in front of me.</i>

00:00:48.680 --> 00:00:51.360
<i>I've got a lucky charm, too!</i>

00:00:51.360 --> 00:00:52.610
It'll bring you luck!

00:00:55.460 --> 00:00:58.510
<i>For now, I should focus on trash pickup...</i>

00:00:59.420 --> 00:01:00.250
Huh?

00:01:00.250 --> 00:01:01.200
This is heavy.

00:01:00.250 --> 00:01:01.200
{OP}

00:02:36.090 --> 00:02:40.540
<b>Fall Chapter, Episode 2

00:02:39.730 --> 00:02:40.550
All right,

00:02:40.550 --> 00:02:42.250
now you're all clean.

00:02:42.250 --> 00:02:44.190
I'm surprised he's doing so well.

00:02:44.190 --> 00:02:46.560
I wonder why he was in a place like that.

00:02:47.560 --> 00:02:50.650
You've made another
 big discovery, Hachiken.

00:02:50.650 --> 00:02:52.650
It's not like I wanted to!

00:02:53.570 --> 00:02:55.610
No collar, so he must be a stray.

00:02:55.610 --> 00:02:56.650
What're you going to do with him?

00:02:57.110 --> 00:02:59.600
Can anyone adopt him?

00:02:59.600 --> 00:03:00.610
No way.

00:03:00.610 --> 00:03:02.410
Everyone's lives in the dorm.

00:03:00.850 --> 00:03:02.170
So fluffy!

00:03:04.330 --> 00:03:06.700
Guess I'll try to find him a home.

00:03:07.010 --> 00:03:09.540
Man, how am I gonna do this?

00:03:08.360 --> 00:03:12.270
<i>Wait, he just took on a big task
 without thinking twice.</i>

00:03:13.910 --> 00:03:17.130
Now that I think about it, 
there were lots of dogs

00:03:17.130 --> 00:03:18.550
at the Ban'ei racing track stables.

00:03:18.780 --> 00:03:22.220
Yeah, lots of people have 
them as guard dogs.

00:03:22.930 --> 00:03:23.720
I wonder...

00:03:24.310 --> 00:03:26.100
Can we keep him here?

00:03:27.500 --> 00:03:29.120
Well, I don't know...

00:03:29.450 --> 00:03:32.680
The school's pretty strict 
when it comes to animals...

00:03:32.680 --> 00:03:34.390
I feel like they'd just 
lecture us about how

00:03:34.390 --> 00:03:36.110
we'd get overrun if we took in
 every animal we found...

00:03:36.110 --> 00:03:37.820
I guess it might be a lost cause...

00:03:37.820 --> 00:03:40.400
Hey, why are you all standing around?

00:03:40.720 --> 00:03:42.510
Did you figure out what to do about the dog?

00:03:43.220 --> 00:03:45.200
Sakuragi-sensei, um...

00:03:45.750 --> 00:03:48.040
Can we keep this dog here?

00:03:48.460 --> 00:03:49.370
Sure, why not?

00:03:50.930 --> 00:03:53.420
The cats around here are 
strays I've adopted, too.

00:03:54.310 --> 00:03:57.430
This place is full of animals, anyway.

00:03:57.430 --> 00:03:59.840
What difference would 
one or two more make?

00:04:02.010 --> 00:04:04.190
Oh, okay...

00:04:04.990 --> 00:04:06.260
Yay!

00:04:06.710 --> 00:04:09.010
You're ours from now on!

00:04:09.710 --> 00:04:12.850
Now that we've decided, 
he needs a rabies shot.

00:04:12.850 --> 00:04:15.390
We don't know what he might've 
been exposed to, either,

00:04:15.390 --> 00:04:17.860
so we should have the vet 
give him a check up, too.

00:04:18.700 --> 00:04:21.360
This is turning into a super practical 
discussion all of a sudden.

00:04:21.360 --> 00:04:22.650
It's important.

00:04:23.330 --> 00:04:25.560
How much do vaccinations cost for dogs?

00:04:25.560 --> 00:04:28.770
The first round costs around six to
 seven thousand yen, including a registration fee.

00:04:28.770 --> 00:04:31.530
You also need to give him a rabies shot annually,

00:04:31.530 --> 00:04:33.380
which costs about three thousand yen.

00:04:33.380 --> 00:04:35.600
If you include combination vaccine shots,

00:04:35.600 --> 00:04:36.960
you'll pay over ten thousand a year, easily.

00:04:40.440 --> 00:04:41.490
Fine!

00:04:41.490 --> 00:04:42.670
I'll foot the bill!

00:04:42.900 --> 00:04:44.480
Wow, you're generous.

00:04:45.140 --> 00:04:48.160
I've still got some money left over 
from my summer job, so I'll use that!

00:04:48.160 --> 00:04:49.230
Are you sure?

00:04:49.230 --> 00:04:50.820
Isn't it for something important?

00:04:51.230 --> 00:04:54.140
I found him, so I'll 
make it work somehow!

00:04:54.670 --> 00:04:56.310
What an unexpected expense...

00:04:56.310 --> 00:05:00.110
<i>I guess you can't just ignore 
people or animals in need.</i>

00:05:00.490 --> 00:05:02.340
What're you going to do 
about the cost of feeding him?

00:05:02.340 --> 00:05:03.990
You can't make it a club expense.

00:05:05.530 --> 00:05:07.910
Maybe I'll use my summer 
earnings for that, too.

00:05:07.910 --> 00:05:11.350
Who's gonna pay after you graduate?

00:05:11.350 --> 00:05:12.830
I know what you should do.

00:05:13.800 --> 00:05:15.790
I'm going to take a bit 
of this bamboo broom.

00:05:19.610 --> 00:05:20.730
Done.

00:05:21.270 --> 00:05:24.250
<b>Snack Fees</b>

00:05:27.620 --> 00:05:28.890
Okay, go!

00:05:34.650 --> 00:05:36.390
Oh, whose dog is that?

00:05:36.390 --> 00:05:38.030
Look at that funny thing 
hanging from his neck.

00:05:38.410 --> 00:05:39.620
Oh, I see.

00:05:39.620 --> 00:05:42.310
He's making money to feed himself.

00:05:42.310 --> 00:05:43.780
What a good boy.

00:05:46.880 --> 00:05:48.910
Aw, so cute!

00:05:48.910 --> 00:05:50.370
It says "snack fees!"

00:05:50.370 --> 00:05:51.300
So funny!

00:05:51.300 --> 00:05:52.480
I'll give him 10 yen!

00:05:52.480 --> 00:05:53.950
Oh, me, too!

00:05:55.960 --> 00:05:58.580
Have him wear this donation box 24/7!

00:05:58.580 --> 00:05:59.970
Nice job, Tokiwa.

00:05:59.970 --> 00:06:00.870
Bravo!

00:06:00.870 --> 00:06:04.170
You should use those brains for studying!

00:06:06.820 --> 00:06:08.770
Hey, how's it going?

00:06:08.770 --> 00:06:11.550
Oh, Ookawa-senpai, hello!

00:06:13.200 --> 00:06:14.120
A dog?

00:06:14.570 --> 00:06:15.810
Oh, yes!

00:06:16.100 --> 00:06:18.540
I found him during the campus clean-up.

00:06:18.540 --> 00:06:19.800
You're going to keep him here?

00:06:19.800 --> 00:06:22.150
Oh... I guess that won't work.

00:06:22.350 --> 00:06:23.030
Kino!

00:06:23.030 --> 00:06:23.610
Yes?!

00:06:23.610 --> 00:06:25.610
Get some scrap wood from 
the forestry department!

00:06:26.010 --> 00:06:27.380
O-Okay!

00:06:31.670 --> 00:06:34.510
He made it without even 
drawing up a blueprint.

00:06:34.510 --> 00:06:37.000
Man... Ookawa-senpai's 
starting to look cool.

00:06:37.380 --> 00:06:40.310
It'd be too risky having a small dog
 running around the stalls.

00:06:40.310 --> 00:06:42.360
Make sure you train him 
to sleep in the dog house!

00:06:42.360 --> 00:06:43.090
Okay!

00:06:44.180 --> 00:06:45.840
How do you train dogs?

00:06:46.280 --> 00:06:49.300
Hachiken-kun, you've never had a dog?

00:06:49.300 --> 00:06:51.920
My dad said a dog would mess up the 
house and damage the furniture.

00:06:51.920 --> 00:06:55.850
If you've got time to care care of one,
 use that time for studying!

00:06:56.770 --> 00:06:59.280
Oh, but I was allowed 
to have pet beetles.

00:06:59.740 --> 00:07:02.770
So it's not like your dad was 
against having any kind of pet.

00:07:02.790 --> 00:07:05.310
He was. But he was okay if 
they were for science class.

00:07:05.730 --> 00:07:06.980
I see.

00:07:09.520 --> 00:07:13.530
I kind of get why you're 
such a nice guy now.

00:07:14.550 --> 00:07:16.250
It's not just because you couldn't have a pet,

00:07:16.250 --> 00:07:18.300
but it sounds like you've been holding 
back on a lot of different things,

00:07:18.300 --> 00:07:21.210
not just because of your dad, 
but also because of yourself.

00:07:23.800 --> 00:07:26.110
And because you didn't 
like having to do that,

00:07:26.110 --> 00:07:29.780
when you see someone holding back or in trouble,
you can't leave them alone.

00:07:30.200 --> 00:07:33.890
I think that's why you involve 
yourself and try so hard.

00:07:34.720 --> 00:07:36.930
Do you really... think so?

00:07:37.440 --> 00:07:40.140
Yeah, I do.

00:07:41.640 --> 00:07:45.910
You let me tell you about my career paths
 over the summer break, remember?

00:07:46.820 --> 00:07:48.820
I really appreciated that.

00:07:51.950 --> 00:07:56.170
You may feel guilt over 
having run away, but...

00:07:56.760 --> 00:07:59.030
<i>Wait, why do I look like a ghost?</i>

00:08:00.240 --> 00:08:04.960
<i>My boring life wasn't useless, 
after all, Headmaster!</i>

00:08:05.440 --> 00:08:07.130
Is the puppy here?

00:08:07.130 --> 00:08:09.970
I brought leftovers from the dining hall!

00:08:09.970 --> 00:08:11.880
Here, here.

00:08:09.970 --> 00:08:11.880
Oh, thanks!

00:08:15.710 --> 00:08:19.600
Huh, so this is what the 
equestrian club does.

00:08:22.890 --> 00:08:24.980
Oh, cool!

00:08:25.390 --> 00:08:26.530
This looks fun!

00:08:26.530 --> 00:08:27.440
Yeah.

00:08:28.250 --> 00:08:29.440
Would you like to try?

00:08:29.440 --> 00:08:30.000
Huh?

00:08:30.000 --> 00:08:31.650
No way!

00:08:31.650 --> 00:08:35.660
Come now. Why not try just sitting on one?

00:08:41.030 --> 00:08:43.760
I'm pretty shaky!

00:08:45.090 --> 00:08:48.160
It's scary, but awesome at the same time!

00:08:48.160 --> 00:08:50.150
Wow! So fun!

00:08:50.150 --> 00:08:51.370
I'm so high up!

00:08:54.130 --> 00:08:55.960
Horses are smart.

00:08:55.960 --> 00:08:57.000
Aren't they?

00:08:57.000 --> 00:08:58.100
I want to ride one again!

00:08:58.100 --> 00:09:00.350
Yeah, come again sometime!

00:09:03.880 --> 00:09:06.190
Hachiken, did you give him a name?

00:09:06.540 --> 00:09:07.820
Not yet.

00:09:07.820 --> 00:09:09.070
What should we call him?

00:09:09.510 --> 00:09:12.000
Maybe "the vice president's dog" for now?

00:09:12.350 --> 00:09:14.150
The vice president's dog, huh...

00:09:14.560 --> 00:09:17.110
The vice president's dog is so cute.

00:09:18.080 --> 00:09:21.010
See you later, Vice President's Dog!

00:09:26.540 --> 00:09:27.980
Yo, Vice President.

00:09:27.980 --> 00:09:29.460
Morning, Vice President!

00:09:29.460 --> 00:09:30.790
Sup, Vice President?

00:09:32.030 --> 00:09:34.260
He's taken over my title!

00:09:34.280 --> 00:09:37.210
<b>Vice Prez</b>

00:09:35.680 --> 00:09:37.840
Vice President is so cute!

00:09:38.660 --> 00:09:40.490
Vice President is adorable!

00:09:41.090 --> 00:09:43.390
He looks pretty smart.

00:09:43.390 --> 00:09:44.800
Are you going to treat him tricks and stuff?

00:09:45.220 --> 00:09:46.500
<i>Damn you...</i>

00:09:46.500 --> 00:09:49.950
<i>Not only did you take my title, 
but you're getting all the attention.</i>

00:09:49.950 --> 00:09:52.090
Vice President has such innocent eyes.

00:09:52.090 --> 00:09:54.340
Vice President has nice fur, doesn't he?

00:09:54.340 --> 00:09:56.600
You make me feel so warm
 and fuzzy, Vice President!

00:09:57.200 --> 00:09:59.940
<i>Oh... But it kind of feels like 
I'm the one being praised.</i>

00:09:59.940 --> 00:10:02.150
Oh, Vice President just peed!

00:10:02.150 --> 00:10:03.840
You have no discipline, Vice President.

00:10:03.840 --> 00:10:06.140
You've got bladder problems, Vice President.

00:10:09.020 --> 00:10:10.090
Whoa!

00:10:10.090 --> 00:10:11.350
Are you trying to get yourself hurt?

00:10:11.350 --> 00:10:12.740
Move!

00:10:14.690 --> 00:10:16.810
You have to stay away from the horses!

00:10:16.810 --> 00:10:18.060
They'll kick you!

00:10:20.320 --> 00:10:22.140
You underestimate me, don't you?

00:10:22.670 --> 00:10:24.100
Move it!

00:10:28.730 --> 00:10:31.280
I thought horses don't step on people?!

00:10:30.750 --> 00:10:31.840
Huh? Sure they do.

00:10:31.840 --> 00:10:33.030
Yes, they do.

00:10:33.030 --> 00:10:34.550
Mikage...

00:10:34.550 --> 00:10:35.730
<i>Whoops.</i>

00:10:36.390 --> 00:10:37.620
You brat!

00:10:37.620 --> 00:10:39.740
You don't listen to anything people say!

00:10:40.130 --> 00:10:41.520
He's supposed to be a guard dog,

00:10:41.520 --> 00:10:42.850
so if you don't train him well,

00:10:42.850 --> 00:10:45.710
it won't be good for anyone, 
including him and the other animals.

00:10:46.650 --> 00:10:47.550
Sit.

00:10:47.990 --> 00:10:50.190
S-i-t.

00:10:52.610 --> 00:10:53.400
Yup.

00:10:53.400 --> 00:10:54.610
That's sit.

00:10:54.920 --> 00:10:56.880
Okay, now stay.

00:10:56.880 --> 00:10:59.030
Oh, don't get up yet!

00:10:59.030 --> 00:11:00.180
Not yet!

00:11:00.180 --> 00:11:02.140
Oh, she's good at this!

00:11:02.140 --> 00:11:04.770
Come to think of it, 
Mikage's family has a dog.

00:11:04.770 --> 00:11:06.140
You're a bad boy, Vice President.

00:11:06.840 --> 00:11:09.100
Why can't you even do this, Vice President?

00:11:09.640 --> 00:11:11.350
You're making no progress, Vice President.

00:11:13.810 --> 00:11:15.610
Mikage, stop!

00:11:15.880 --> 00:11:16.610
What?

00:11:17.090 --> 00:11:18.740
Just stop, okay?

00:11:19.830 --> 00:11:23.570
Dogs are social animals who live 
in packs and establish a hierarchy.

00:11:24.010 --> 00:11:26.330
If you don't sort him 
out soon, Hachiken-kun,

00:11:26.330 --> 00:11:30.290
he'll always treat you like dirt.

00:11:32.200 --> 00:11:34.290
Don't underestimate me, dog...

00:11:34.290 --> 00:11:35.960
Final Exam Score Rankings

00:11:34.610 --> 00:11:35.960
I may not look it...

00:11:35.960 --> 00:11:39.670
Final Exam Score Rankings

00:11:35.960 --> 00:11:39.670
but I've been living through hell for 
many years in a competitive society...

00:11:46.600 --> 00:11:47.010
<b>Dog Obedience Training</b>

00:11:47.100 --> 00:11:48.060
<b>Dog Obedience Training</b>

00:11:58.940 --> 00:12:01.860
<b>Ezonoo Sweet Red Bean Bun</b>

00:12:04.200 --> 00:12:05.070
Want it?

00:12:05.070 --> 00:12:06.030
Want it, huh?!

00:12:06.030 --> 00:12:07.020
Fool!

00:12:07.020 --> 00:12:09.370
You eat <i>after</i> me!

00:12:09.370 --> 00:12:11.790
Not yet!

00:12:11.790 --> 00:12:13.640
What's that guy up to?

00:12:13.900 --> 00:12:16.260
He's using food to establish 
his dominance.

00:12:17.020 --> 00:12:26.010
<b>Vice Prez</b>

00:12:18.080 --> 00:12:20.210
Next up is loose-leash walking!

00:12:20.210 --> 00:12:22.150
I won't let you walk as you please!

00:12:22.820 --> 00:12:24.710
Hey, no barking for no reason!

00:12:29.640 --> 00:12:30.470
Sit!

00:12:32.150 --> 00:12:32.880
Lie down!

00:12:34.460 --> 00:12:35.340
Okay!

00:12:37.980 --> 00:12:39.340
Good job, Hachiken!

00:12:39.340 --> 00:12:40.570
Amazing!

00:12:40.570 --> 00:12:42.330
He's showing his belly!

00:12:42.330 --> 00:12:44.040
He's totally submissive!

00:12:46.590 --> 00:12:47.740
What's wrong?

00:12:48.120 --> 00:12:48.990
He's...

00:12:49.850 --> 00:12:52.580
better at learning things than Tokiwa.

00:12:55.000 --> 00:12:57.500
<b>Chicken Coop</b>

00:12:58.060 --> 00:13:00.130
We'll be dissecting chickens today.

00:13:00.130 --> 00:13:01.340
'Kay!

00:13:01.750 --> 00:13:03.530
They've been thoroughly drained of blood,

00:13:03.530 --> 00:13:05.050
so it won't be a big splatter-fest.

00:13:05.230 --> 00:13:06.120
Don't worry.

00:13:06.440 --> 00:13:07.760
Thank you.

00:13:08.010 --> 00:13:09.180
You have your forceps...

00:13:09.970 --> 00:13:10.910
and scalpel.

00:13:12.910 --> 00:13:14.060
Oops, my bad.

00:13:19.350 --> 00:13:20.290
All right,

00:13:20.290 --> 00:13:22.350
the Ezonoo Festival is coming up soon.

00:13:23.280 --> 00:13:25.060
There are stalls, small events,

00:13:25.060 --> 00:13:27.140
and main stage events to plan.

00:13:27.140 --> 00:13:30.240
If you have any ideas, 
don't hesitate to speak up!

00:13:30.240 --> 00:13:32.640
Oh, oh, oh! I want to do a yakitori stand!

00:13:32.640 --> 00:13:33.620
One for Hokkaido fried chicken, too!

00:13:33.620 --> 00:13:34.680
Agreed!

00:13:34.680 --> 00:13:35.630
Seconded!

00:13:37.790 --> 00:13:40.240
The next livestock sciences 
class will be held outdoors!

00:13:40.240 --> 00:13:42.020
We'll observe a rectal exam!

00:13:42.020 --> 00:13:44.270
Oh! I'd like to do a grilled 
offal stand, too!

00:13:44.270 --> 00:13:45.630
Agreed!

00:13:44.580 --> 00:13:45.630
No objections there!

00:13:48.970 --> 00:13:51.170
The cows are now in heat,

00:13:51.800 --> 00:13:55.430
so let's have a vet show 
us a rectal palpation.

00:13:55.680 --> 00:13:57.900
Thank you for letting us observe!

00:13:58.110 --> 00:14:01.090
For the rectal palpations, 
or "rec palp" for short,

00:14:01.090 --> 00:14:03.050
you put your hand into the anus

00:14:03.050 --> 00:14:05.330
to diagnose any abnormalities 
in the cow's internal organs,

00:14:05.330 --> 00:14:07.320
as well as whether the 
cow is ready to breed.

00:14:08.040 --> 00:14:09.680
First, as you can see,

00:14:09.680 --> 00:14:13.290
you put on a very long glove 
that goes up to your shoulder.

00:14:13.480 --> 00:14:15.290
And then you go into the anus.

00:14:20.550 --> 00:14:22.170
After you scoop out the feces...

00:14:23.600 --> 00:14:26.150
In this case, we're checking 
if the cow is in heat,

00:14:26.150 --> 00:14:28.840
so we'll palpate the ovaries 
through the large intestines.

00:14:29.810 --> 00:14:32.610
I'm never gonna be a vet!

00:14:32.610 --> 00:14:36.600
That'll make it easier for me 
to pass the exam, so thanks.

00:14:37.120 --> 00:14:40.020
Okay, let's see if anyone 
wants to experience this.

00:14:50.200 --> 00:14:51.040
What's wrong?

00:14:51.510 --> 00:14:54.120
I thought you'd make us do it for real...

00:14:54.120 --> 00:14:55.760
If you were a cow,

00:14:56.170 --> 00:14:58.160
do you think you'd want an amateur 
groping around in your butthole?

00:14:59.030 --> 00:15:02.290
We wouldn't want that by 
amateurs <i>or</i> professionals!

00:15:03.920 --> 00:15:05.590
I was just kidding.

00:15:05.590 --> 00:15:07.530
The Freshman War's about to 
come up for all of you guys.

00:15:07.910 --> 00:15:12.010
We can't have you risking an injury 
by trying it on a real cow.

00:15:12.010 --> 00:15:13.860
Oh, makes sense.

00:15:13.860 --> 00:15:16.470
It'd be a real problem if Komaba got hurt.

00:15:17.070 --> 00:15:18.580
Oh, right.

00:15:18.580 --> 00:15:19.940
I'll be careful.

00:15:20.480 --> 00:15:22.050
After the Freshman War,

00:15:22.050 --> 00:15:23.710
I'll let you guys try your 
hand with a real cow.

00:15:23.710 --> 00:15:24.900
No thanks!

00:15:27.910 --> 00:15:30.260
<i>Shove my hand up a poopy anus?</i>

00:15:30.260 --> 00:15:31.200
<i>No way...</i>

00:15:38.050 --> 00:15:40.540
It'd be a real problem if Komaba got hurt.

00:15:42.250 --> 00:15:43.460
Komaba! Watch out!

00:15:48.010 --> 00:15:50.300
Okay, vaccine done!

00:15:50.300 --> 00:15:52.170
Thank you.

00:15:53.730 --> 00:15:54.720
Sensei!

00:15:56.670 --> 00:15:57.780
You have an emergency patient.

00:15:58.380 --> 00:15:59.020
Oh?

00:15:59.020 --> 00:16:01.050
Was he kicked by a cow?

00:16:01.660 --> 00:16:05.520
No, he tried to get out of the way 
when a cow slipped and fell...

00:16:05.520 --> 00:16:06.730
Komaba! Watch out!

00:16:09.100 --> 00:16:09.690
Suicide.

00:16:09.890 --> 00:16:10.660
What?!

00:16:10.660 --> 00:16:11.650
Is the cow all right?

00:16:12.290 --> 00:16:13.360
She is.

00:16:13.790 --> 00:16:18.370
Shouldn't this school have 
ethics classes or something?

00:16:19.400 --> 00:16:21.340
All right, where'd you get hit?

00:16:21.940 --> 00:16:23.210
Around here...

00:16:23.210 --> 00:16:25.500
All right, show me your behind.

00:16:26.960 --> 00:16:31.920
No!

00:16:35.750 --> 00:16:38.100
Hey! Still a virgin?

00:16:38.100 --> 00:16:40.270
He just put a medicated 
plaster on the bruise!

00:16:40.700 --> 00:16:43.910
Komaba's got better reflexes than you.

00:16:43.910 --> 00:16:46.270
You should've just moved 
and let him be, Hachiken.

00:16:46.270 --> 00:16:48.540
Well, sure, but...

00:16:48.540 --> 00:16:49.790
Hachiken?

00:16:49.790 --> 00:16:51.940
Are you the one who adopted that dog?

00:16:51.940 --> 00:16:52.700
Oh, yes.

00:16:52.930 --> 00:16:54.890
I see, I see.

00:16:54.890 --> 00:16:57.640
It's rare to see someone who'll take 
responsibility for a stray dog

00:16:57.640 --> 00:16:59.400
and take good care of him.

00:16:59.400 --> 00:17:00.350
I'm impressed.

00:17:00.350 --> 00:17:01.200
Good for you!

00:17:02.510 --> 00:17:05.140
Oh, well, it's nothing...

00:17:05.710 --> 00:17:08.170
<b>Rabies Vaccine Receipt 
 </b>Owner: Hachiken Yuugo  Name of Pet: Vice President

00:17:08.640 --> 00:17:12.130
Make sure you get your back and hip
 looked at by a human doctor.

00:17:12.320 --> 00:17:13.550
Okay...

00:17:15.060 --> 00:17:18.640
Shall I examine the cow 
that fell, just in case?

00:17:18.640 --> 00:17:21.060
Yes, please.

00:17:21.490 --> 00:17:24.150
I heard the cow slipped on manure and fell.

00:17:24.150 --> 00:17:25.130
Did you clean it up?

00:17:25.130 --> 00:17:26.750
We did.

00:17:26.750 --> 00:17:28.580
We sprinkled non-skid
coating on the floor.

00:17:28.580 --> 00:17:31.070
It looks like that's a slippery spot.

00:17:31.070 --> 00:17:33.640
Can't we change the flooring, 
even if only for that spot?

00:17:33.640 --> 00:17:35.970
I'd feel bad if another one fell.

00:17:36.610 --> 00:17:38.690
Everyone's so cold.

00:17:38.690 --> 00:17:40.980
You all care more about cows than people.

00:17:40.980 --> 00:17:42.750
Stop being so cynical.

00:17:42.750 --> 00:17:45.110
You look fine to me.

00:17:45.110 --> 00:17:46.290
When livestock get injured,

00:17:46.290 --> 00:17:49.590
we have to make a snap judgment 
whether to let it live or die.

00:17:50.550 --> 00:17:54.800
If that cow had dislocated its pelvis,

00:17:54.800 --> 00:17:57.270
it would have been sent to the
 slaughterhouse before sundown.

00:17:58.160 --> 00:18:00.780
I'm glad I wasn't born as one...

00:18:00.780 --> 00:18:01.680
Right?

00:18:02.110 --> 00:18:05.310
Hachiken-kun, let's just go 
to the school infirmary.

00:18:05.750 --> 00:18:08.850
<i>I'm glad I'm treated as a 
human being, at least.</i>

00:18:13.320 --> 00:18:15.510
I guess you can't go riding today.

00:18:15.510 --> 00:18:18.920
Too bad. I was really looking forward to it.

00:18:18.920 --> 00:18:22.360
This could've been avoided 
if you'd just moved

00:18:22.360 --> 00:18:24.330
without trying to warn me.

00:18:24.730 --> 00:18:28.480
But, Komaba, you're the team's best hope.

00:18:28.860 --> 00:18:31.750
You're trying to go to Nationals, 
so I know you don't want to get injured...

00:18:31.750 --> 00:18:34.550
Oh, is that what you were thinking about?

00:18:34.550 --> 00:18:36.110
In that split second?

00:18:37.190 --> 00:18:40.300
Man, you think fast,

00:18:40.300 --> 00:18:42.220
but your body just can't act as fast, huh?

00:18:42.680 --> 00:18:46.680
Hmph! Unlike you, my brain hasn't 
become one with my muscles!

00:18:46.680 --> 00:18:48.220
Ow...

00:18:49.470 --> 00:18:51.520
It's the thought that counts, 
so I appreciate it.

00:18:53.630 --> 00:18:54.480
Thanks.

00:18:58.190 --> 00:19:01.020
It's creepy when you get all serious.

00:19:02.940 --> 00:19:04.140
You bastard!

00:19:04.710 --> 00:19:06.250
Sorry, sorry, sorry!

00:19:06.250 --> 00:19:07.500
It's not safe!

00:19:06.710 --> 00:19:08.330
Icchan, c'mon.

00:19:08.330 --> 00:19:09.720
Stop!

00:19:09.610 --> 00:19:12.040
You have the Freshman War, too!

00:19:12.210 --> 00:19:14.670
Stop worrying about other people 
and take care of yourself!

00:19:15.020 --> 00:19:17.300
I couldn't help it, okay? 
I acted before I even knew it!

00:19:17.300 --> 00:19:19.160
Wait, why does it even matter?

00:19:19.160 --> 00:19:21.790
I'm less important than 
livestock at this school!

00:19:21.790 --> 00:19:22.760
Oh, you might be right there.

00:19:22.760 --> 00:19:24.140
I wanted you to say that isn't true!

00:19:25.610 --> 00:19:27.260
It's great that you're a nice guy, okay?

00:19:27.260 --> 00:19:28.810
But you have to tone it down.

00:19:30.070 --> 00:19:33.860
It's not easy to watch you get 
yourself hurt over it.

00:19:35.120 --> 00:19:37.350
Just let people like me handle themselves.

00:19:37.710 --> 00:19:39.610
You should stop looking after others so much

00:19:40.180 --> 00:19:41.740
and do what <i>you</i> have to do.

00:19:44.820 --> 00:19:46.490
All right. That's it for today.

00:19:47.030 --> 00:19:49.890
Keep brainstorming stuff 
for the Ezonoo Festival.

00:19:49.890 --> 00:19:51.790
We'll finalize plans by 
the end of next week!

00:19:51.790 --> 00:19:53.210
'Kay!

00:19:53.500 --> 00:19:55.920
How about working with the agricultural 
sciences department and making curry?

00:19:56.020 --> 00:19:57.210
Taiyaki!

00:19:57.210 --> 00:19:59.170
I wanna grill and eat giant sausages.

00:19:59.170 --> 00:20:01.060
Everyone's all about food!

00:20:01.510 --> 00:20:03.650
They're all so into it...

00:20:03.650 --> 00:20:04.940
Well, sure!

00:20:04.940 --> 00:20:05.980
It's the festival!

00:20:05.980 --> 00:20:08.470
<i>You</i> don't seem so into it, Hachiken.

00:20:09.770 --> 00:20:13.500
I don't really get why arranging 
a festival is such a big deal.

00:20:13.500 --> 00:20:16.260
My junior high didn't have events like that.

00:20:16.640 --> 00:20:19.760
If you don't push what you want 
and come up with a lot of ideas,

00:20:19.760 --> 00:20:22.570
you're gonna get stuck with 
all the annoying stuff.

00:20:26.390 --> 00:20:29.650
What <i>I</i> want, huh?

00:20:33.730 --> 00:20:35.740
The Ezonoo Festival's 
right around the corner.

00:20:35.740 --> 00:20:36.720
What do you think?

00:20:36.720 --> 00:20:38.610
Should we do something as a club?

00:20:38.610 --> 00:20:40.630
Clubs do stuff, too?

00:20:40.960 --> 00:20:42.910
How about a petting zoo?

00:20:42.910 --> 00:20:44.050
Horseback rides?

00:20:44.050 --> 00:20:45.510
Hey, you guys!

00:20:45.970 --> 00:20:49.110
Spend more time thinking about the
 Freshman War than events for the Festival!

00:20:49.110 --> 00:20:52.980
Ookawa-senpai, stop coming here 
every day and find a job!

00:20:59.460 --> 00:21:00.990
Very nice.

00:21:00.990 --> 00:21:02.990
I'm looking forward to the Freshman War.

00:21:02.990 --> 00:21:05.660
All right! I'll do my part, too!

00:21:14.990 --> 00:21:17.920
Oh? He seems to have mastered "shake."

00:22:45.740 --> 00:22:51.170
This story is a work of fiction.
